  "name": {
    "zh": "mos_雨滴",
    "en": "mos_rain"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "生成式雨天玻璃：水珠从零出现，小水珠偶尔下滑，积水多了变成持续下落的长水流；细雾瞬间出现后慢慢淡出。靠近的水珠会融成不规则水洼，带硬接触线、锐高光、色散与磨砂。",
    "en": "Generative rain on glass: drops appear from nothing, small drops slip down now and then, and once enough water gathers it becomes a long stream that keeps falling. Mist pops in and slowly fades. Nearby drops merge into irregular puddles, with hard contact lines, sharp highlights, dispersion and frost."
  },
